    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aec005412c6fd0d5103be6be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……呃，明明训练员帮忙了我的忙，我却这么说，\n很没有说服力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42f2e737baabafe8e240d60cab2d50e2290686b8eb9617c5da39c0e9eea5388a",
