    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91df5f084dbb3ba2d2f91c3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谢谢。要让这个想法不只是嘴上说说，我也要更加努力了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eb3c6497d46e6dfc6f7f5f403ac66c43b30a3bbdf3d563df62294100501aa96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:832190d520bbd7253c84804f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "责任心强，上进心强。这是好事――\n但是，我觉得她还是该多依赖一下周围的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8611fd55c68ae740398fa4b57ce8fa14d0364dd908c10d2c0e0fb59e3ba71ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f6c54cb062740bd1218d999",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同班的马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "92dbf0e8179f77a8dff9781f38ad1e5e06b989a2e217a3c4c1ca9128d17214b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c986eced79743e52fb802d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "诶！？……真的可以吗？那……拜托你了？我下次一定找个机会好好感谢你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fde59410a9cc56461e7368d5c4b418387c115a8b672bbb81376f2fab7461ab3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25f219a1c181fbdae0267243",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（今天也在被人依赖着啊）",
      "source_fingerprint": "238253d75da9bc39a438add3790b41ab930882c40e3afd0a8902457d7cd465db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
