    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3eb210d6aafb3a00cb1c1da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈，谢谢什么的无所谓啦。只是随手帮了个忙！\n面谈要加油哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba4c998a199177be54c99806db31bb0b3d63653f2bd53e7b72f70fd6f6d880eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077005.json",
