    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca8ad8c01fa2b0f26966c77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "工作的时候，窗外传来的对话声让我微笑起来。\n成田路的可靠程度今天好像也还健在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e1f7beeef5c503fce04c32d65ed4f8868fce039360a070c6f104776017f6b6f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7c51813a5d05d4c8d905f31",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "继续着手里的文书类工作。\n处理完手上剩余的工作后，我朝着操场走去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4202431d0121961cb3efa7479a71f9440f74f5821592647468a552c45f278b54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2577327bf714e1089d9a735",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（咦……？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d7e590b4f2fa8526145ed4abcb7b7a00d935db7a2a0fea916e4cb331b5ff1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077005.json",
